Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, category-sorted JSON, summed quantities, and exact Decimal totals formatted as two-digit strings.

Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with a useful stderr message and no traceback. Processing remains separate from argument parsing. README includes the grouped example and expected output.

All 10 supplied tests pass unchanged. Additional decimal precision and malformed CSV checks pass.
